 "remarks": "Beautiful 1 bedroom 1.5 bathroom unit, waiting for you to call it home! This ranch style unit is perfectly located to all Norwalk has to offer. This open floor plan creates an easy flow from the kitchen to the living room to half bath allowing the bedroom and full bath to remain private. The beautiful kitchen has custom cabinetry, granite countertops and stainless-steel appliances. The patio overlooks the large, well-maintained lawn. Washer and dryer are located in the unit. Plenty of closet space in the unit and an additional storage unit in the next building. One assigned spot is in front of the building and additional visitor spots are around the complex.",
